.real-scale/

# The compaction benchmark's collection, when it is pointed inside the tree.
# Rebuilt by `npm run bench:compaction`; the measured one was 4.96 GB after
# migrating and 10.54 GB at its widest, and its numbers are in
# `docs/performance/phase-18-storage.md` where they do not take up a disk.
.compaction/
